0..75 Comment "// A definition whose selected arm is another definition\'s call, stuck at a"
76..151 Comment "// variable: `viaZero(Zero, h)` selects `emp(h)`, which cases on `h` and so"
152..227 Comment "// runs no further. The call converts with the call its arm reached, at any"
228..293 Comment "// depth of such arms, and the kernel replays each step. A family"
294..370 Comment "// computed by recursion on its index is unfolded only as far as the index\'s"
371..443 Comment "// constructors take it (Dybjer, _Inductive families_, Formal Aspects of"
444..490 Comment "// Computing 6, 1994, doi:10.1007/BF01211308)."
491..493 Comment "//"
494..509 Comment "// - see: #2832"
511..547 Comment "// The naturals that select the arm."
